      "output": "**Focus for the coming week**\n\n1. **Internship CV** \u2013\u202fDedicate the first\u202f3\u202fdays to a solid draft.  \n   - Day\u202f1: Outline sections (education, projects, skills, experience).  \n   - Day\u202f2: Flesh out each section, using concise bullet points.  \n   - Day\u202f3: Refine wording, ensure consistent formatting, and add a brief personal statement.\n\n2. **Programming exam preparation** \u2013\u202fReserve the remaining\u202f4\u202fdays for focused study.  \n   - Day\u202f4\u20115: Review core concepts and work through practice problems in the topics you find toughest.  \n   - Day\u202f6\u20117: Simulate a timed exam, then review mistakes and reinforce weak areas.\n\n**Next actions**  \n-\u202fTomorrow morning, create the CV outline (about 30\u202fminutes).  \n-\u202fSet a daily 90\u2011minute study block for the exam topics you\u2019re least confident about.  \n\nLet me know if you\u2019d like a more detailed study\u2011topic list or a quick checklist for the CV draft.",
