conclusions | Write the conclusion, policy/academic implications, and limitations; draft abstract | Full draft of conclusion & abstract |\n| 12 | Revision & polishing | Incorporate supervisor comments, proofread, format references, and prepare final submission checklist | Ready\u2011to\u2011submit dissertation |\n\n**Next step:** Please tell me your specific dissertation topic (or at least the main field and research question) so I can tailor the key literature sources and methodological suggestions to your study.",
