      "output": "I\u2019m assuming you want a 7\u2011day outline that fits your usual 4\u202f\u00d7\u202fweek upper\u2011lower split, uses the dumbbells\u202f/\u202fpull\u2011up bar at home, and works around travel on Thursday\u2011Friday when you\u2019ll have no gear.\n\n**Day\u202f1\u202f(Mon) \u2013 Upper (home gym)**\n- Pull\u2011ups\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202fmax reps (use band assistance if needed)  \n- Dumbbell bench press\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f8\u201110  \n- One\u2011arm dumbbell row\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f8\u201110 each side  \n- Standing dumbbell shoulder press\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f10\u201112  \n- Triceps\u2011extension (dumbbell)\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f12\u201115  \n\n**Day\u202f2\u202f(Tue) \u2013 Lower (home gym)**\n- Goblet squat\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f10\u201112  \n- Romanian\u2011deadlift with dumbbells\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f10\u201112  \n- Walking lunges\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f12 each leg  \n- Single\u2011leg calf raise (bodyweight)\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f15\u201120  \n\n**Day\u202f3\u202f(Wed) \u2013 Upper (home gym)**\n- Chin\u2011ups\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202fmax (band assist if needed)  \n- Incline dumbbell press (feet on bench or floor)\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f8\u201110  \n- Dumbbell reverse fly\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f12\u201115  \n- Arnold press\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f10\u201112  \n- Hammer curl\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f12\u201115  \n\n**Day\u202f4\u202f(Thu) \u2013 Travel (no equipment) \u2013 Full\u2011body bodyweight**\n- Push\u2011ups\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202fmax  \n- Air squats\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f20\u201125  \n- Inverted rows under a sturdy table\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202fmax  \n- Plank\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f45\u202fs  \n\n**Day\u202f5\u202f(Fri) \u2013 Travel \u2013 Full\u2011body bodyweight**\n- Pike push\u2011ups\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202fmax  \n- Bulgarian split squat (using a chair)\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f12\u201115 each leg  \n- Door\u2011frame rows\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202fmax  \n- Side\u2011plank\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f30\u202fs each side  \n\n**Day\u202f6\u202f(Sat) \u2013 Lower (home gym)**\n- Dumbbell front squat\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f8\u201110  \n- Dumbbell deadlift\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f8\u201110  \n- Reverse lunges\u202f2\u202f\u00d7\u202f12 each leg  \n- Standing calf raise (hold dumbbells)\u202f3\u202f\u00d7\u202f15\u201120  \n\n**Day\u202f7\u202f(Sun) \u2013 Active recovery / mobility**\n- Light jog or brisk walk\u202f20\u201130\u202fmin (optional)  \n- Full\u2011body stretch routine\u202f10\u201115\u202fmin  \n\n**Progression rule:** each week aim to add 2\u20115\u202f% more weight on the dumbbell lifts or 1\u20112 extra reps on the bodyweight sets, while keeping form strict. If you feel overly fatigued, repeat the same load before increasing.\n\n*If you have any current injuries or limitations, let me know so I can tweak the movements.*",
